{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "佐賀県出身   19歳    佐藤愛桜です🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日、発売の「blt graph.vol.115」に掲載"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "させて頂いています✨️"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "表紙は天さんです！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "天さんのお写真とインタビュー記事を見たくて今日が来ることを楽しみにしていたというお話はここだけの秘密です🤫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏を沢山感じながら撮影させて頂きました~"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobKDqG8S.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobVipd6j.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobrLfXeh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "インタビューもして頂き、四期生ライブについてなどをお話しています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひチェックして下さると嬉しいです🫶🏼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob1tKUwy.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobBSaSAs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob7lfySo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobotFmA2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、本日19時放送の"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「ヒューマングルメンタリーオモウマイ店」に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大園玲さんと出演させて頂いています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どれも美味しそうなメニューばかりで、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜーんぶ食べたくなっちゃいました🤤"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非ご覧ください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「外番組ではこうするんだよ~」と沢山の事を教えてくださりました！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます🫶🏼"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「ねおちゃんにも後輩ちゃんが出来たら教えてあげてね！」と伝えて下さったことをこの先、行動に移せるよう成長します！！頑張ります！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好きな大園さんと📷⟡.·"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobuPS4Q1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobxdVFKz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで見て下さりありがとうございました🌸"}], "source": "official"}